            "sid": "1TH 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alhhe'eesaywo qitla nguri harslaaqataán. Tari al'axweesaán atén kiloorén tawa diirír Athénér i meetaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hhiyaarén Timoteo kuri ya/aawaán. Inós a sagadiyusmoó wák oo Mungú dinkwa nee atén baraá gadiyér Ya/abtór hho' ar Kristo kawa alki/iitaan. Inós atén nguna ya/aawaán as kuungá' nuwa gurkwa/asi nee haratlintaaorhúng ngiwa gawdeesi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "asma baraá tla/angwhunge hee miwa deeruút oo alií kií/ as slahh'eemisuuwí. Kuungá' kilá' a xuá', adór atén gár tiwa hariím aqo slahh'eemisuú adór kwí un slawaán. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qoomaadá' atén tawa dirhúng i kahhaan, atén kuungá' naa qaroó ádbawaán adór slahh'eemis kur slawaán. Nee adoorí an adoodá' aa tleehharut hamí, adoodá' kuungá' kara xué'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaarí an gár aníng Timoteo ngusa ya/aáw, asma aníng qitla una harslaaqaát, ana xu'utír wa slaá', xáda xáy haratlintaaorhúng Neetlaangw gura bá/i, kudá' kuungá' nu iiara'ár, laqaá gadiyeédá' atén taa tleehhaán sleémeero aa gadiyér tawo tleehhít.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.3.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala Timoteo niwa amorhúng wa wayaá', kángw hhó' oo haratlintaaorhúng nguri huúw, nee oo sla'aarirhúng. Atén tina ádbáy adór kuungá' atén tir ló'wa inslasleerá' umuúqo daqto, nee ti artá wa sla'á' adoorír atén kuungá' nur artá wa sla'aan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gawaá adoorihe, hháe, atén tam baraá slahha'amaayér úr i diriiana, ala kángw haratlintaaorhúng atén taa ló'wa gurkwa/ás. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuungá' bar aga gawduuré' baraá Aakoowo, slafingwrén daqaní ku amohhoó'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ilahhooár bu'uút oo ta Mungú i haniisaan as kuungá', dír kway leehhaan a xuanaaká, nee as qwal/uudá' yaariír oo ta koomaan dír geeraá Munguhe as kuungá'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Xweera nee tlaatla/aango Mungú un ló'wa firiirimaán as gitsee/erhúng ngiwa malé araan, nee muruudá' aa /aaruy baraá haratlintaaorhunge kuwa /abeesaan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.3.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mungú Baabá inósuú kilá' nee Aakoorén Yesu atén ti amorhúngií geerahaari. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aako inósuú kilá' sla'aarirhúng ngi ak doogi tiwa kiloohúng sla'asla'a', nee muu sleémeero kuwa sla'a', adoodá' atén kuungá' nur sla'aan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inós kuungá' nu /uurií haniisi, tawa múk hhohhó' oo xaslaansli wásl geeraá Mungú Baabuúrene qoomaadá' Aakoorén Yesu niwa hardihi, dinkwa nee mukós oo hhohhó' sleémeero.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.3.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
